          caption: "Ask two questions at every wound: is the wound tetanus-prone, and is this person immunised? Unknown or incomplete immunity with a dirty wound means toxoid now and immunoglobulin in the other arm — the farmer who 'cannot recall ever being immunised' is the classic examination patient.",
